{"page":478,"exact":true,"blocks":[{"x":0.04849,"y":0.05257,"w":0.29299,"h":0.01535,"fs":0.01535,"n":2,"t":"第8章：积分技巧"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.09317,"w":0.17855,"h":0.01449,"fs":0.01407,"n":2,"t":"例题4 评估"},{"x":0.59022,"y":0.12237,"w":0.07279,"h":0.01727,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"∫ex cos x dx."},{"x":0.32331,"y":0.16455,"w":0.4976,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"解 令 u = ex 和 dy = cos x dx。那么 du = ex dx，y = sin x，并且"},{"x":0.50079,"y":0.19654,"w":0.15657,"h":0.01727,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"∫ex cos x dx = ex sin x -"},{"x":0.68237,"y":0.19654,"w":0.07007,"h":0.01727,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"∫ex sin x dx."},{"x":0.32333,"y":0.2317,"w":0.59312,"h":0.02815,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"第二个积分与第一个类似，只是将 cos x 替换为 sin x。为了评估它，我们使用分部积分法，其中"},{"x":0.41454,"y":0.26559,"w":0.40651,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":4,"t":"u = ex，dy = sin x dx，y = -cos x，du = ex dx。"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.2931,"w":0.03362,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"那么"},{"x":0.43446,"y":0.31463,"w":0.25194,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"∫ex cos x dx = ex sin x - a-ex cos x -"},{"x":0.71141,"y":0.31463,"w":0.10653,"h":0.02323,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"(-cos x)(ex dx)b"},{"x":0.51053,"y":0.36024,"w":0.15408,"h":0.01727,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"= ex sin x + ex cos x -"},{"x":0.68962,"y":0.36024,"w":0.07279,"h":0.01727,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"∫ex cos x dx."},{"x":0.32331,"y":0.39541,"w":0.59292,"h":0.02814,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"未知的积分现在出现在等式的两边。将积分加到等式的两边，并加上积分常数给出"},{"x":0.50188,"y":0.43826,"w":0.25763,"h":0.01879,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"∫ex cos x dx = ex sin x + ex cos x + C1。"},{"x":0.47606,"y":0.44273,"w":0.02414,"h":0.02362,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"2 L"},{"x":0.32331,"y":0.47343,"w":0.39082,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"除以2并重新命名积分常数给出"},{"x":0.50029,"y":0.49373,"w":0.21327,"h":0.02446,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"∫ex cos x dx = ex sin x + ex cos x"},{"x":0.6494,"y":0.50472,"w":0.10355,"h":0.02067,"fs":0.01279,"n":2,"t":"2 + C."},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.55933,"w":0.40655,"h":0.01449,"fs":0.01407,"n":1,"t":"例题5 获得一个公式，该公式用较低次幂的 cos x 的积分来表示"},{"x":0.59772,"y":0.58851,"w":0.05782,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"∫cosn x dx"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.62368,"w":0.31786,"h":0.01281,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"。"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.64156,"w":0.44278,"h":0.02238,"fs":0.01918,"n":2,"t":"解 我们可以将 cosn x 视为 cosn-1 x # cos x。然后我们令"},{"x":0.48187,"y":0.66908,"w":0.27183,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"t":"u = cosn-1 x 和 dy = cos x dx，"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.6966,"w":0.04317,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"因此"},{"x":0.4271,"y":0.71512,"w":0.38137,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":3,"t":"du = (n - 1) cosn-2 x (-sin x dx) 和 y = sin x。"},{"x":0.32332,"y":0.74264,"w":0.19811,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"分部积分给出"},{"x":0.38108,"y":0.77012,"w":0.2459,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"∫cosn x dx = cosn-1 x sin x + (n - 1)"},{"x":0.64464,"y":0.77012,"w":0.1129,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"∫sin2 x cosn-2 x dx"},{"x":0.44622,"y":0.80976,"w":0.18076,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"= cosn-1 x sin x + (n - 1)"},{"x":0.64464,"y":0.80976,"w":0.15871,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"(1 - cos2 x) cosn-2 x dx"},{"x":0.44622,"y":0.84941,"w":0.18077,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"= cosn-1 x sin x + (n - 1)"},{"x":0.64464,"y":0.84941,"w":0.14882,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"∫cosn-2 x dx - (n - 1)"},{"x":0.8111,"y":0.84941,"w":0.06188,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"∫cosn x dx."},{"x":0.32333,"y":0.88459,"w":0.06177,"h":0.01279,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"如果我们加上"},{"x":0.62351,"y":0.91847,"w":0.05782,"h":0.01728,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"∫cosn x dx"},{"x":0.55429,"y":0.92228,"w":0.05158,"h":0.01347,"fs":0.01279,"n":1,"t":"(n - 1)"}]}